+/*
+ * sst_stream_drop_wait - fence for the queued trigger-path DROP (L17)
+ *
+ * Called from the platform hw_free path before the ALSA managed DMA buffer is
+ * released, so a stream the trigger could only queue a non-blocking stop for
+ * has its DSP DROP completion resolved (or quarantine + DSP stall) first.
+ */
